  "summary": {
    "en": "Ecuadorian footballer Jhon Perlaza received an eight-year ban after throwing a stone at an assistant referee, illustrating violence spilling into sport. Fishermen from Ecuador have filed lawsuits against the United States, alleging a drone strike sank their boat near the Galápagos, linking the incident to broader security concerns. Pete Hegseth met with President Noboa and visited Honduras to discuss regional anti-narco cooperation, extending the focus of security efforts beyond Ecuador. The UCDP counted two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.",
